*** Settings ***
Documentation     [PURPOSE] Set of keywords used for 5GC001586 feature tests cases
...
...               Automation author           : christophe.samson@nokia.com
...               Automation contact          : christophe.samson@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 29-June-2020
...               Modified Date               : 29-July-2020
