Convert and Check Xp
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 1586-C: test purpose is to check UL Tput
    [Arguments]                    ${captureXp}     ${ul_ratio_to_check}=100
    # Dated log            captureXp = ${captureXp}
    Dated log                       Calculate UL throughput on gnb L2Lo case ...
