    OAM Disconnect                          ${GNB_DU.oam}

    # Restore WTS cfg file name
    # Run Keyword If   '${Param.seq.bandwidth}'!='10MHz'    restoreFilename

    Dated Log         Collect /ram/startup_l3.log and egate_console.log from Airphone...
